The Snowball stemmer runtime and the per-language stemmers ported from
the Snowball project (https://snowballstem.org/) are used under
analysis/lang/a, analysis/lang/b, and analysis/stem/snowball, including:

  - the shared Snowball runtime base classes (SnowballProgram,
    SnowballAmong),
  - the generated per-language stemmers: Turkish, Irish, Hungarian,
    Catalan, Basque, Armenian, Serbian, Lithuanian, Estonian, Romanian,
    French, Italian, Spanish, Finnish, Russian, Danish, Norwegian, and
